{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"黑洞"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“黑洞”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>黑洞是"},{"Local":{"url":"广义相对论","text":"广义相对论"}},{"Plain":"中时空极度扭曲的一个区域, 使得光无法从中逃脱.</p>\n<p>黑洞的边界称为事件视界 (event horizon).</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Schwarzschild度规","text":"Schwarzschild 度规"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"Kerr度规","text":"Kerr 度规"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>唯一性</h3>\n<h3>稳定性</h3>\n<h3>Penrose 不等式</h3>\n"}]}}